                                "sense_id": "26175871-9e88-3dae-a492-f9b60f78b91b",
                                "text": "It is clear , by the applauses bestowed on what the author calls this new constitution , a mixed oligarchy , that the difference between the Clubbists and the old adherents to the Monarchy of this Country is hardly worth a scuffle."
